<p class="0 0 0 right 0 0" just="left"><cdq/>.</p>
</sect>
<sect id="SEC4">
<number>4.</number><title>
<p class="0 0 0 left 0 0" just="left"><b>Short title, construction and collective citation
</b></p>
</title>
<p class="0 0 0 justify 0 0" just="left"></p>
<p class="-5 5 0 justify 2 0" just="left"><b>4.</b> (1) This Act may be cited as the European Parliament Elections (Amendment) Act 2014.</p>
<p class="-3 5 0 justify 2 0" just="left">(2) The European Parliament Elections Acts 1992 to 2013 and this Act shall be read together as one and this Act shall be included in the collective citation <odq/>European Parliament Elections Acts 1992 to 2014<cdq/>.</p></sect>
</body>
</act>